"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the later-departing Aeroplan award via Hong Kong if arriving sooner and keeping the connection short matter most. The tradeoff is a later arrival than the Taiwan option, and the award quotes do not establish total trip costs.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J14@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T09:50\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan via Hong Kong\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO Jan. 15 at 11:15 p.m. and arrives BKK Jan. 17 at 9:50 a.m.; the award is economy on TG/UA with one stop at HKG and a 70-minute connection. It reports 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 107.40 in award taxes, both with unknown quote scope. One traveler is supported by the award evidence; 9 seats are reported, but availability should be confirmed. Leg-by-leg cabins were not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier arrival via Taiwan\",\"v\":\"Arrives BKK Jan. 17 at 1:25 a.m., 8 hours 25 minutes before the Hong Kong choice; it also departs 11 hours 15 minutes earlier and takes 2 hours 50 minutes longer in elapsed travel time. It is an Aeroplan economy award on BR via TPE, with a 4-hour-30-minute connection, for 65,000 Aeroplan points plus a quoted CAD 116.50 in taxes of unknown scope. Only 1 seat is reported, though the award evidence supports the requested one traveler; confirm current availability. Leg-by-leg cabins were not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T05\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T06\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J3@2027-01-15T11:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T11:05\",\"n\":\"Lower reported tax quote, longer travel\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award via PEK uses TG/UA, with a reported 13-hour-25-minute connection. It departs Jan. 15 at 11 a.m. and arrives Jan. 17 at 11:05 a.m.; elapsed travel is 33 hours 5 minutes. The quote is 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 102.00 in taxes, scope unknown—the lowest reported CAD tax quote among these three shown awards, not a confirmed lower total cost. Award evidence supports one traveler and reports 9 seats; confirm availability. Leg-by-leg cabins were not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline: Singapore Airlines\",\"v\":\"The cash search result is USD 440.00 for a one-stop SFO–SIN–BKK itinerary departing Jan. 15 at 9:40 a.m. and arriving Jan. 17 at 8:25 a.m. Its price scope is unknown, so it is a cash reference—not a verified party total or directly comparable all-in cost against the award quotes.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The award quotes are partial: points and taxes are listed separately, and their scope is unknown. The search results are not necessarily real-time, so confirm current award availability and prices with the booking providers. Search coverage was partial, with some routes and dates omitted.\"}]}"
